2. **Copy your custom fields**: After calling the base class method, you should explicitly copy each of your custom fields from the source object to the destination object.

Here’s a simple example:

```systemverilog
class my_custom_object extends uvm_object;
  // Custom fields
  int my_field;
  string my_string;

  // Constructor
  function new(string name = "my_custom_object");
    super.new(name);
  endfunction

